# No Abbreviations

Never abbreviate variable names, function names, parameters, or any other identifiers. Always use full, descriptive names.

```elixir
# BAD
def handle_msg(msg), do: ...
Enum.each(procs, fn proc -> ... end)
def get_fni(id), do: ...
def calc_total(items), do: ...

# GOOD
def handle_message(message), do: ...
Enum.each(processes, fn process -> ... end)
def get_flow_node_instance(id), do: ...
def calculate_total(items), do: ...
```

This applies to all languages in the project.
